 DFT-FE branch: PAWjctc, commit: 17f048ac47a4ff651bdc25cd2c1cf00ab26ecccb
 compiled with GPU support, with ONECCL support, with OpenMP support, with 64 bit integers, and with HIGHERQUAD_PSP
